{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790499120, "covers_from": "2026-09-27T08:52:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-27T08:53:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790499180, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-27T08:52:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 20718, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "交通", "content": "尖峰時段很多大路口都會出現車跟行人都卡在路中間能分車子可行跟行人可行時間（車走人停，人走車停）", "display_name": "萬華代表 吳秉家", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T08:52:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 28710, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "觀光", "content": "市長好！西門捷運站6號出口下雨天都會有平台擁擠的問題，目前是透過廣播提醒大家不要逗留，建議能擴建出口", "display_name": "萬華代表 Doris", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T08:52:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9814, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "雖然不是台北人，但常北上參與活動，去過日本街道，即使小小的町都有美麗行道樹與花圃，誠心希望把樹種回！", "display_name": "松山代表 惠玲", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T08:52:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 15291, "sprite_key": "turtle_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "長照", "content": "為什麼只有行動不便的身心障礙才能享有停車費用優惠，那其他身心障礙的人卻不能享有同等權益，有損公平", "display_name": "信義代表 No.15,291", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 28710, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 Doris", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 9814, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 惠玲", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 15291, "sprite_key": "turtle_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.15,291", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 52511, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_n